## 🔵 Complete Priority Roadmap

```
P0 — Fix Now:
  1. SkipBack onClick handler
  2. Fix bottom nav + player height collision (bump player to bottom-[70px] on mobile)
  3. Make Recommendation rows clickable
  4. Widen progress bar touch target (transparent overlay, min 16px)
  5. Fix queue panel bottom offset

P1 — This Week:
  6. Add Shuffle + Repeat buttons to Player
  7. Add Like/Heart button to Player bar
  8. Add mobile volume slider (vertical, appears on tap of volume icon)
  9. "Recently Played" section in HomeAlbums
  10. Dynamic greeting (morning/afternoon/evening)
  11. Right-edge fade-out on horizontal scroll carousels
  12. Remove hamburger from mobile header (bottom nav replaces it)
  13. "Personal Listening Mode" card → collapse into single small line

P2 — Next Sprint:
  14. Create Playlist → floating modal
  15. Expanded "Now Playing" screen (tap album art → full-screen view)
  16. Recent searches in Search
  17. Duration shown in search results
  18. Song duration shown in playlist detail
  19. "Now Playing" pulsing indicator on home song cards
  20. Staggered fade-in animation for home category rows
  21. Marquee scroll for long titles in Player bar
  22. `navigator.vibrate(10)` on play/skip/like
  23. App name fix: YouWe ♥
```

